t 'em up!<br></li><li>Steam Achievements and Global Score.<br></li><li>Easy to learn in Arcade style, with simple commands.<br></li><li>A wide variety of weapons, power-ups, and ship upgrades.<br></li><li>Great variation of enemies.<br></li><li>Steam cloud support.<br></li><li>Beautiful pixel-art graphics.<br></li><li>Full support for controls.<br></li><li>Retro sound effects.<br></li><li>Waves of enemies generated in a semi-procedural way.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A semi-procedural shoot-'em-up that will test your skills. Level up your ship, unlock amazing weapons, and defeat 5 formidable bosses. Challenge the infinite by facing real-time waves of enemies after completing all missions. Become the intergalactic hero now!",
